     "titulo": "Structured notes",
     "texto": [
      "Organise your notes with a thesis and two or three reasons; underneath add examples and terms you want to check. Nominalisations such as **planlegging** («planning») or **vedlikehold** («maintenance») condense ideas. Leave space to complete them later; don't copy whole paragraphs."
